content:
Repair the repository for the user's request. Respond with one JSON action per turn, without markdown.
Available actions:
{"action":"list_files"}
{"action":"read_file","path":"filename"}
{"action":"search","query":"literal text"}
{"action":"write_file","path":"filename","content":"complete source"}
{"action":"run_tests"}
{"action":"finish"}
Only existing .py source files other than tests.py can be edited. Do not invent actions.
